window.SKL_I18N={"zhHans":{"company":{"name":"国林顾问有限公司","english":"SKL Consultancy Limited","tagline":"提供公司并购、法律支援、上市融资、会计及税务等一站式专业服务","summary":"SKL成立于2022年9月，作为香港独有的综合专业服务顾问公司，我们服务范围包括：公司并购、上市融资、科学调查报告、会计及税务、法律支援、资料保护、版权纠纷、企业及物业评估、企业推广等的一站式服务。","phone":"(852) 95886463","phoneDigits":"85295886463","email":"sklcl@yahoo.com","address":"香港九龙尖沙咀科学馆道1号康宏广场17楼1715室","wechat":"STARLEAD8"},"services":[{"route":"cn-scientificinvestigation","title":"科学调查","image":"assets/science.jpg","content":["科学调查","以数据为眼，为决策赋能","在资讯爆炸的时代，精准洞察远比盲目行动更重要。国林顾问的「科学调查」服务，结合严谨的学术方法与前沿技术，为企业揭开市场迷雾，将复杂数据转化为清晰的行动指南。","我们的服务内容","跨领域专业团队","由数据科学家、行业分析师及法律顾问组成专案小组，从资料搜集、模型建立到结果解读，全程确保科学性与合规性。","技术驱动的精准分析","运用AI演算法、大数据挖掘及统计建模技术，针对以下领域提供深度洞察：","市场趋势预测：解读消费者行为与行业动态，预判未来商机。","竞争对手分析：透过公开数据与隐性资讯，掌握对手策略弱点。","商业纠纷证据链：以科学方法验证事实，为法律攻防提供强力支持。","客制化报告交付","我们拒绝「模板化输出」，每份报告均包含：","可视化数据图表（热力图、趋势线等）","风险机遇双维度解读","具体行动建议与执行路径","应用场景","企业并购前的尽职调查","品牌进入新市场的可行性评估","商业纠纷中的证据搜集与分析","产品开发前的消费者需求验证","为何选择我们？","「数据会说谎，但科学不会。」我们坚持三项原则：","全程可追溯：所有数据来源与分析步骤透明化","跨界整合：结合法律合规性与商业实务需求","快速响应：紧急案件提供48小时初步分析报告"]},{"route":"cn-lawconsultancy","title":"法律支援","image":"assets/legal.jpg","content":["法律支援","您的商业后盾，风险防线的筑造者","在复杂多变的商业战场中，法律风险无处不在。国林顾问的「法律支援」服务，结合香港本地法规深度理解与国际化实务经验，为企业与个人提供从预防到应对的全方位法律保障，让您专注核心业务，无惧合规挑战","我们的服务内容","商业合约与纠纷","合约草拟与审核：确保条款符合香港《公司条例》及国际商业惯例。","商业纠纷调解与诉讼：从版权争议、合约违约到股东权益纠纷，提供攻守兼备的法律策略。","知识产权保护","商标注册与维权：协助企业完成香港及全球商标布局。","版权侵权处理：快速取证与法律追诉，捍卫创意价值。","资料保护与合规","依据香港《个人资料（私隐）条例》，制定企业数据管理方案。","跨境法律支援","国际商事仲裁与跨境合约执行。","海外投资架构设计与法律风险评估。","为何选择我们？","一站式整合服务","法律问题从不孤立存在。我们与公司内部的财务、调查团队无缝协作，例如：","科学调查：为法律纠纷提供数据化证据链。","企业评估：结合资产估值与法律尽职调查，保障并购安全。","深耕香港，实战经验丰富","精通香港《竞争条例》《版权条例》等商业法规。","成功案例涵盖初创企业融资协议、跨国集团仲裁案件。","敏捷应对，成本可控","紧急案件提供24小时初步法律意见。","弹性收费模式：按项目、按时长或风险代理收费，贴合客户需求。"]},{"route":"cn-corporatefinance","title":"企业融资","image":"assets/finance.jpg","content":["企业融资","为企业成长注入动力，为愿景铺平道路","在竞争激烈的商业环境中，资金是企业成长的命脉。国林顾问的「企业融资」服务，结合专业的财务规划与市场洞察，协助企业从初创到扩张阶段，量身定制最适合的融资策略，让您的商业愿景不再受资金限制。","我们的服务内容","融资策略规划","评估企业现状与未来需求，制定短期与长期的融资计划。","提供多元融资方案，包括股权融资、债务融资及混合融资。","投资者匹配与路演支援","根据企业定位与发展阶段，匹配合适的投资者或金融机构。","协助准备商业计划书、财务模型及路演材料，提升融资成功率。","跨境融资与结构设计","针对跨国企业或跨境业务，设计税务优化的融资架构。","提供国际资本市场融资咨询，包括香港、新加坡及欧美市场。","上市筹备与执行","协助企业完成香港主板或创业板上市的筹备工作。","提供上市前的财务审计、法律合规及市场定位建议。","为何选择我们？","专业团队，全程陪伴","由资深财务顾问、法律专家及市场分析师组成专案小组。","从策略制定到执行落地，全程提供专业支援与实务建议。","数据驱动的决策支持","结合科学调查与市场分析，提供数据化的融资可行性评估。","运用AI工具与大数据技术，精准预测融资效果与风险。","本地化与国际化双重优势","深谙香港资本市场规则与投资者偏好。","拥有丰富的跨境融资经验，协助企业链接全球资金。"]},{"route":"cn-coporatedispute","title":"版权/商业纠纷","image":"assets/dispute.jpg","content":["版权/商业纠纷","捍卫您的权益，化解商业冲突","在知识经济时代，版权与商业纠纷已成为企业运营中的常见挑战。国林顾问的「版权/商业纠纷」服务，结合法律专业与实战经验，为客户提供从预防到解决的全方位支援，确保您的权益得到最大保障。","我们的服务内容","版权保护与维权","版权注册与管理：协助企业完成香港及国际版权注册。","侵权调查与取证：运用科学调查技术，搜集侵权证据。","法律追诉与和解：透过诉讼或谈判，维护客户的版权利益。","商业纠纷解决","合约纠纷处理：针对合约违约、履行争议等问题，提供法律意见与解决方案。","股东权益纠纷：协助处理股东间的利益冲突与权利争议。","商业秘密保护：制定保密协议与追诉泄密行为，保护企业核心资产。","跨境纠纷支援","国际商事仲裁：代表客户参与国际仲裁程序，维护跨境商业利益。","跨境法律协调：协助处理涉及多国法律的商业纠纷。","为何选择我们？","法律与调查双重优势","由资深律师与私家侦探组成专案小组，确保法律策略与证据搜集的无缝衔接。","运用AI工具与大数据技术，提升调查效率与证据可信度。","本地化与国际化双重保障","精通香港《版权条例》及国际知识产权法规。","拥有丰富的跨境纠纷处理经验，协助客户应对国际法律挑战。","灵活应对，成本可控","提供诉讼、调解、仲裁等多种解决方案，灵活应对不同纠纷情境。","弹性收费模式，包括按项目、按时长或风险代理收费，降低客户负担。"]},{"route":"cn-businesspromote","title":"企业推广","image":"assets/promotion.jpg","content":["企业推广","让您的品牌脱颖而出，赢得市场青睐","在资讯爆炸的时代，企业推广不仅是传递讯息，更是塑造品牌价值与建立客户信任的关键。国林顾问的「企业推广」服务，结合市场洞察与创意策略，为企业量身定制高效推广方案，助力品牌在竞争中脱颖而出。","我们的服务内容","品牌定位与策略规划","市场调研与竞争分析：深入了解目标市场与客户需求。","品牌定位与核心讯息提炼：塑造独特的品牌形象与价值主张。","多渠道推广执行","数位行销：包括社交媒体推广、搜索引擎优化（SEO）及线上广告投放。","传统媒体：策划电视、广播及平面媒体广告，扩大品牌影响力。","活动策划：举办产品发布会、行业展览及客户活动，提升品牌曝光度。","内容创作与传播","创意文案与视觉设计：打造吸引眼球的广告内容与品牌故事。","公关传播：透过新闻稿、媒体采访及KOL合作，提升品牌公信力。","效果追踪与优化","数据分析与报告：运用AI工具与大数据技术，追踪推广效果。","持续优化策略：根据数据反馈，调整推广方案以最大化投资回报。","为何选择我们？","专业团队，创意驱动","由市场分析师、创意总监及数位行销专家组成专案小组。","提供从策略规划到执行落地的全方位服务。","数据驱动的决策支持","结合科学调查与市场分析，提供数据化的推广策略建议。","运用AI工具与大数据技术，精准预测推广效果与市场反应。","本地化与国际化双重优势","深谙香港市场特性与消费者行为。","拥有丰富的跨境推广经验，协助企业拓展国际市场。"]},{"route":"cn-dataprotection","title":"资料保护","image":"assets/data-protection.jpg","content":["资料保护","守护您的数据，保障您的未来","在数位化时代，数据已成为企业最宝贵的资产，同时也是最脆弱的环节。国林顾问的「资料保护」服务，结合法律合规与技术防护，为企业提供全方位的数据安全管理方案，确保您的业务运营无后顾之忧。","我们的服务内容","合规咨询与审计","依据香港《个人资料（私隐）条例》及国际标准（如GDPR），进行数据保护合规评估。","提供合规审计报告，识别潜在风险并制定改进计划。","数据安全管理","设计并实施数据分类与分级保护策略。","提供数据加密、存取控制及备份方案，确保数据安全与可用性。","员工培训与意识提升","定期举办数据保护培训，提升员工的数据安全意识。","提供模拟钓鱼攻击测试，评估并强化企业的防御能力。","事件应急响应","建立数据泄露应急预案，确保快速反应与最小化损失。","提供事件调查与法律支援，协助企业应对监管机构与客户质询。","为何选择我们？","法律与技术双重保障","由法律专家与IT安全顾问组成专案小组，确保合规性与技术可行性。","提供从政策制定到技术实施的无缝衔接服务。","本地化与国际化双重优势","深谙香港《个人资料（私隐）条例》及国际数据保护法规。","协助跨国企业满足GDPR等国际合规要求。","定制化解决方案","根据企业规模与行业特性，量身定制数据保护方案。","提供持续监控与定期更新服务，确保长期合规与安全。"]},{"route":"cn-propertvaluation","title":"商业及物业评估","image":"assets/valuation.jpg","content":["商业及物业评估","精准估值，为您的资产把脉","在复杂多变的市场环境中，资产价值评估是企业决策的关键。国林顾问的「商业及物业评估」服务，结合专业知识与数据驱动的分析方法，为客户提供精准、可靠的估值报告，助您掌握资产真实价值，做出明智决策。","我们的服务内容","企业价值评估","财务分析与预测：评估企业的盈利能力、现金流及未来成长潜力。","市场比较法：参考同行业企业的交易数据，提供市场化估值。","资产基础评估：针对企业的实物资产与无形资产进行全面估值。","物业估值","住宅、商业及工业物业估值：依据市场趋势与物业特性，提供精准估值报告。","特殊物业评估：包括酒店、停车场及发展中项目，满足不同需求。","跨境物业估值：协助客户评估海外物业价值，提供国际化视野。","尽职调查与风险评估","并购与融资尽职调查：为企业并购、上市融资提供专业估值支援。","风险评估与管理：识别资产估值中的潜在风险，提供应对建议。","为何选择我们？","专业团队，数据驱动","由注册估值师、财务分析师及市场研究专家组成专案小组。","本地化与国际化双重优势","深谙香港物业市场与商业环境，提供本地化估值服务。","拥有丰富的跨境评估经验，协助客户应对国际化挑战。","定制化解决方案","根据客户需求，提供一次性估值或长期资产管理服务。","结合法律与财务顾问团队，确保估值报告的全面性与合规性。"]},{"route":"cn-corporatereorganization","title":"公司重组","image":"assets/corporate-restructure.jpg","content":["公司重组","重塑结构，释放企业潜能","在快速变化的商业环境中，企业需要灵活的结构与策略来应对挑战。国林顾问的「公司重组」服务，结合法律、财务与营运专业知识，协助企业优化结构、提升效率，并为未来成长奠定坚实基础。","我们的服务内容","结构优化与重组规划","评估企业现有结构，识别效率瓶颈与风险点。","制定重组方案，包括部门整合、业务拆分及控股结构调整。","财务重组与债务管理","设计债务重组方案，改善企业财务状况。","提供资本结构优化建议，平衡股权与债权比例。","法律合规与风险管理","确保重组过程符合香港《公司条例》及相关法规。","识别并管理重组中的法律与税务风险。","员工与文化整合","提供人力资源重组方案，优化组织架构与人才配置。","协助企业文化整合，提升团队凝聚力与执行力。","为何选择我们？","专业团队，全程陪伴","由法律顾问、财务专家及营运策略师组成专案小组。","从诊断、规划到执行，提供一站式重组服务。","数据驱动的决策支持","结合科学调查与财务分析，提供数据化的重组建议。","运用AI工具与大数据技术，模拟重组效果与风险。","本地化与国际化双重优势","深谙香港商业环境与法规，确保重组合规性。","拥有丰富的跨境重组经验，协助企业应对国际化挑战。"]},{"route":"cn-mergeandacquisition","title":"收购合并","image":"assets/merger.jpg","content":["收购合并","驱动企业成长，创造协同价值","在竞争激烈的商业环境中，收购合并是企业快速扩张、提升市场竞争力的关键策略。国林顾问的「收购合并」服务，结合法律、财务与市场洞察，为客户提供从策略规划到执行落地的全方位支援，确保每一笔交易都能创造最大价值。","我们的服务内容","策略规划与目标筛选","市场调研与行业分析：识别潜在收购目标与合并机会。","交易结构设计：根据客户需求，设计最优的收购或合并方案。","尽职调查与风险评估","财务尽职调查：评估目标公司的财务状况与潜在风险。","法律尽职调查：确保交易合规并识别潜在法律问题。","营运尽职调查：分析目标公司的业务模式与市场竞争力。","交易执行与谈判支援","协助客户进行交易谈判，确保最佳条款与条件。","提供法律文件审核与交易执行支援，确保流程顺利。","并购后整合与管理","制定并购后整合计划，包括组织架构、业务流程及文化融合。","提供持续支援，确保协同效应最大化与风险最小化。","为何选择我们？","专业团队，全程陪伴","由法律顾问、财务专家及市场分析师组成专案小组。","从策略规划到执行落地，提供一站式收购合并服务。","数据驱动的决策支持","结合科学调查与财务分析，提供数据化的交易建议。","运用AI工具与大数据技术，模拟交易效果与风险。","本地化与国际化双重优势","深谙香港商业环境与法规，确保交易合规性。","拥有丰富的跨境交易经验，协助企业应对国际化挑战。"]},{"route":"cn-dentreorganization","title":"债务重组","image":"assets/debt.jpg","content":["债务重组","化解财务压力，重启成长引擎","在经济波动与市场竞争的双重压力下，债务问题可能成为企业发展的绊脚石。国林顾问的「债务重组」服务，结合法律、财务与营运专业知识，协助企业重新规划债务结构，减轻财务负担，为未来成长创造空间。","我们的服务内容","债务结构分析与评估","全面审视企业财务状况，识别债务问题的核心原因。","提供数据化的债务分析报告，明确重组需求与目标。","重组方案设计与执行","设计债务重组方案，包括延长还款期限、降低利率及债务转股等。","协助与债权人谈判，达成双方共识并签订重组协议。","法律合规与风险管理","确保重组过程符合香港《公司条例》及相关法规。","识别并管理重组中的法律与税务风险。","财务规划与营运优化","提供现金流管理与财务规划建议，确保重组后的财务稳健。","协助企业优化营运流程，提升盈利能力与偿债能力。","为何选择我们？","专业团队，全程陪伴","由法律顾问、财务专家及营运策略师组成专案小组。","从诊断、规划到执行，提供一站式债务重组服务。","数据驱动的决策支持","结合科学调查与财务分析，提供数据化的重组建议。","运用AI工具与大数据技术，模拟重组效果与风险。","本地化与国际化双重优势","深谙香港商业环境与法规，确保重组合规性。","拥有丰富的跨境重组经验，协助企业应对国际化挑战。"]},{"route":"cn-trademarkregistration","title":"商标注册","image":"assets/trademark.jpg","content":["商标注册","保护品牌价值，奠定市场优势","在品牌竞争日益激烈的商业环境中，商标是企业最重要的无形资产之一。国林顾问的「商标注册」服务，结合法律专业与市场洞察，协助企业高效完成商标注册，确保品牌价值得到全面保护，为市场竞争奠定坚实基础。","我们的服务内容","商标检索与评估","进行全面的商标检索，确保注册申请的独特性与可行性。","提供专业评估报告，识别潜在冲突与风险。","注册申请与文件准备","协助准备并提交商标注册申请文件，确保符合香港《商标条例》要求。","提供国际商标注册服务，涵盖中国内地、欧盟及美国等主要市场。","注册过程跟进与维护","全程跟进注册进度，及时回应官方审查意见。","提供商标续期、变更及转让等后续服务，确保商标权益长期有效。","商标维权与纠纷处理","协助处理商标侵权案件，提供法律意见与诉讼支援。","针对异议或无效宣告，制定应对策略并提供法律支援。","为何选择我们？","专业团队，高效服务","由资深知识产权律师与商标代理人组成专案小组。","提供从检索、申请到维权的一站式服务，确保高效与专业。","本地化与国际化双重优势","精通香港《商标条例》及国际商标注册流程。","拥有丰富的跨境商标注册经验，协助企业拓展全球市场。","数据驱动的风险管理","运用AI工具与大数据技术，提升商标检索的准确性与效率。","提供数据化的风险评估报告，帮助客户做出明智决策。"]}],"people":[{"route":"cn-stephen-wong-kai-yi","name":"黄继儿大律师","english":"Stephen Wong Kai-yi · Barrister at Law","image":"assets/stephen-wong.jpg","content":["黄继儿大律师","专业资历","学历与资格：","香港大学本科毕业，后获政府法律奖学金赴英国深造。","拥有英国最高法院律师资格、伦敦经济及政治学院法学硕士学位（专攻知识产权、民事诉讼、海商和航运保险），以及澳洲高等法院大律师资格。","曾于清华大学、哈佛大学肯尼迪公共行政学院等顶尖学府进修。","职业经历：","1986年加入香港律政署，历任高级检控官、助理刑事检控专员及副首席检察官，主理回归法律事务。","1997年晋升为首席政府律师，主管人权、基本法及香港与内地法律事务，成为首位华人副律政专员。","2007至2012年间，以首长级官员身份派驻香港驻布鲁塞尔及柏林经济贸易办事处，并担任柏林办事处处长。","2015年至2020年，担任香港个人资料私隐专员，推动数据保护与隐私合规。","现为私人执业大律师，专注于人权、专业操守、金融与数据监管及商业纠纷等领域。","社会职务：","现任香港大数据治理公会独立审批委员会主席、香港基因组中心顾问。","兼任北京师范大学法律学院特邀教授、大湾区国际信息科技协会大数据专家等职务。","团队优势","黄继儿大律师的加入，为国林顾问带来了国际化的视野与深厚的法律专业知识。他的丰富经验与广泛人脉，使我们能够为客户提供从法律咨询到跨境纠纷解决的全方位服务。无论是企业并购、数据保护，还是商业诉讼，我们的团队都能以专业、高效的方式，为客户保驾护航。"]},{"route":"cn-patrick-wong","name":"黄龙德教授","english":"BBS，JP · Patrick Lung-tak Wong","image":"assets/patrick-wong.jpg","content":["黄龙德教授，BBS，JP","专业资历","学历与资格：","香港理工学院会计学及管理研究文凭毕业。","英格兰及威尔斯特许会计师公会资深会员、英国特许公认会计师公会资深会员、英国国际会计师公会资深会员。","香港公司治理公会资深会士、香港特许秘书公会资深会士、香港税务学会资深会员。","职业经历：","前香港华人会计师公会主席","创办黄林梁郭会计师事务所，提供全面的会计、审计及税务服务。","担任多间上市公司独立非执行董事，协助企业提升治理水平与财务透明度。","曾于香港理工大学会计及金融学院担任兼任教授（2002-2013），并获广东省江门市五邑大学聘为客座教授。","社会职务：","香港浸会大学基金会董事、会计及法律系会计学咨议会主席。","香港华人永远坟场管理委员会委员、土瓜湾街坊福利会理事长。","曾任云南省第九届及第十届政协委员，积极参与社会事务与公益活动。","专业贡献","监票专家：黄教授被誉为「御用监票师」，曾监督多项大型活动的投票与抽奖过程，包括香港电台《十大中文金曲》、TVB香港小姐选举等，确保公正与透明。","慈善服务：热心公益，为超过300间非牟利机构提供义务核数服务，并多次捐款支持教育事业，包括设立「黄龙德会计师事务所有限公司奖学金」。","行业领导：活跃于会计师公会、税务学会等专业组织，推动行业发展与专业标准提升。","团队优势","黄龙德教授的加入，为国林顾问带来了深厚的会计专业知识与广泛的社会资源。他的丰富经验与卓越领导力，使我们能够为客户提供从财务审计、税务规划到公司治理的全方位服务。无论是企业上市、财务重组，还是慈善机构的核数需求，我们的团队都能以专业、高效的方式，为客户创造价值。"]},{"route":"cn-robert-chui","name":"崔志仁会计师","english":"Robert Tsui Chi Yan MH","image":"assets/robert-chui.jpg","content":["崔志仁会计师 MH","专业资历","学历与资格：","1978年获授商学士学位，并成为香港执业会计师。","1989年及1991年分别获英国特许公会会计师公会及香港会计师公会资深会员资格。","职业经历：","现任志仁会计师行有限公司董事总经理，专注于企业审计、税务规划及财务咨询。","曾担任多家联交所上市公司的独立非执行董事，包括谢瑞麟珠宝（国际）有限公司、国艺娱乐文化集团有限公司等。","现任亚洲木薯资源控股有限公司、F8企业（控股）集团有限公司等企业的独立非执行董事。","社会职务：","现任香港交通安全队名誉总监，并担任运输及房屋局属下多个委员会成员。","深圳-香港青年交流促进会创会主席兼永远会长，积极推动两地青年交流与合作。","中国教育建设基金主席，致力于教育公益事业。"]},{"route":"cn-alexander-tai","name":"戴国良","english":"Alexander Tai Kowk Leung","image":"assets/alexander-tai.png","content":["戴国良","戴国良先生从事证券买卖, 协助公司上市, 企业融资和收购合并等业务30多年, 为行内著名的顶尖金融财经专家。曾任VMS集团担任合伙人至2013年。在VMS证券有限公司任职期间，他个人监管规模达25亿美元的资产管理业务，","亦曾在毕马威会计师事务所、普华永道会计师事务所以及渣打亚洲有限公司任要职, 对银行及资产管等金融领域具丰富经验.","专业资历","资深会计师/证监会注册财务顾问(Type 4)","英国特许公认会计师公会资深会计师","香港执业会计师公会注册会计师 1983","证监会根据证券及期货条例核准，可以经营第1类(买卖股票)，第4类(向投资者作出建议)及第9类(资产管理)牌照。","专业经验","沈阳市盛京银行(港交所上市编号：2066)非执行董事","财华社集团执行董事兼负责人","中华人民共和国山东省政治协商委员会委员","药明生物（2269）独立非执行董事、审核委员会主席及提名委员会成员。","香港资本市场专业人员协会秘书长，推动香港金融服务行业的发展。"]},{"route":"-jp","name":"刘诗韵","english":"Serena Lau Sze Wan JP","image":"assets/serena-lau.jpg","content":["刘诗韵 JP","专业资历","学历与资格：","拥有香港大学工商管理硕士（MBA）学历，并为香港注册专业测量师（产业测量），持有FHKIS、AAPI、MRICS等专业资格，以及香港测量师学会资深会员和澳洲会计师公会纪律委员会委员等身份。","职业经历：","担任永利行评值顾问有限公司（RHL International）董事总经理，专注于香港、内地及海外地区的房地产评估、市场调研及项目可行性研究，曾参与中国江苏省昆山丹桂苑渡假区主题公园的策划、发展及营运顾问工作，并为内地地方政府单位及发展商提供可持续性分析、规划及发展建议服务。","社会职务：","现任香港房屋委员会委员、商业楼宇小组委员会主席及策划小组委员会委员、香港房屋协会监事会委员、法律援助服务局成员、中医药发展基金咨询委员会主席、青年发展委员会委员、工业贸易署中小企业委员会委员、香港测量师学会纪律委员会委员、香港医务委员会业外审裁员，曾任市区更新基金董事、地产代理监管局成员及香港测量师学会会长。"]},{"route":"cn-tam-yiu-kwok","name":"谭耀强","english":"Tam Yiu Keung","image":"assets/tam-yiu-keung.jpg","content":["谭耀强","专业资历","职业经历：","曾任香港海关助理关长（情报及调查），负责领导多项重大执法行动，成功冻结多个犯罪集团的资产，有效打击盗版及侵权活动。","2010年与国际刑警组织合办国际知识产权执法会议，分享香港海关的执法经验，并推动全球执法合作。","在任期间，成功将盗版罪行纳入《有组织及严重罪行条例》，大幅提升打击盗版的力度与效果。","专业领域：","专注于知识产权保护、有组织犯罪调查及国际执法合作，为企业提供全面的风险管理与合规建议。"]},{"route":"alan-au","name":"区纪伦大律师","english":"Alan Au Kai Lun · Barrister at Law","image":"assets/alan-au.jpg","content":["区纪伦大律师","区纪伦先生在公司重组，收购合并，商业争议，监管及纪律事务及上市规则方面有丰富的专业知识及丰富经验，亦专长处理广泛的刑事及民事诉讼，特别是有关证券及期货监管条例的案件。","专业资格：","香港城市大学法学博士","美国佛罗里达国际大学会计学硕士","美国佛罗里达国际大学经济系学士","香港执业大律师","CPA 注册会计师","职业经历：","香港会计师公会法律与合规任务小组主席 (2021)","香港会计师公会管治委员会委员 (2019-2021)","香港会计师公会选举委员会委员 (2019-2023)","香港会计师公会税务执行委员会委员 (2019-2022)","香港会计师公会重组及破产专业委员会委员 (2019-2023)"]},{"route":"cn-chow-hin","name":"周显","english":"Micro Chow Hin","image":"assets/chow-hin.jpg","content":["周显","专业资历","知名财经作家,资深政治及经济公关，人称「周大师」。现时在 《明报》、《AM730》、《头条日报》、《星岛日报》、《橙新闻》、《香港商报》及内地 《观察者网》 撰写专栏，以及经营Youtube频道 《阿周电视》。他出版过多本不同类型的著作，包括《炒股密码》及 《炒股实战》等畅销专书。","投资成就：","1999年首次接触股票市场，仅用半年时间便以10万元本金赚取1000万元，展现其卓越的投资眼光与策略执行力。","多年来在股票投资领域屡创佳绩，除2002年外，投资胜率高达80%，并公开个人投资记录以证其实战能力。","擅长捕捉市场趋势与价值投资机会，为客户提供精准的投资建议与资产配置方案。","时事评论与写作：","拥有十年报社主笔经验，二十年时事评论员资历，长期为媒体撰写专栏，分析经济、政治与社会动态。","出版多本投资与市场分析书籍，以浅白文字与幽默笔触分享实战心得，深受读者喜爱。","市场洞察与策略规划：","结合投资经验与时事分析能力，为企业提供市场趋势预测与竞争策略建议。","擅长从宏观经济与微观市场角度，解读政策变化与行业动态，协助客户把握商机。"]}],"about":["关于我们","联络我们","繁体中文","简体中文","English","国林顾问有限公司于2022年9月成立，致力成为企业及个人客户的战略性伙伴。在瞬息万变的商业环境中，我们深知客户面临的挑战不仅多元且环环相扣，单一领域的服务已不足以应对复杂需求。因此，我们突破传统顾问框架，集合法律、金融、科技及市场策略领域的顶尖专家，打造香港首屈一指的跨领域顾问服务平台。","一站式专业网络","不论是企业并购的财务规划、版权纠纷的法律攻防，抑或是科学调查的数据验证，我们提供无缝衔接的服务链：","前期策略：市场调研、风险评估、融资结构设计。","执行支援：法律文件审核、资产估值、商标注册。","长期维系：资料保护合规、企业重组咨询、品牌推广策略。","客户无需在多间机构间周旋，所有需求皆由国林团队高效统筹。","立足香港，放眼全球","团队深谙本地及国际法规，为客户提供兼具本地化与国际化的专业服务：","本地化优势：团队精通香港《公司条例》《版权条例》等法例，并熟悉本地物业估值标准与税务政策。","国际化视野：团队协助客户应对国际商业仲裁、跨境并购及全球税务规划等国际事务，提供无缝衔接的国际资源。","客制化解决方案","从初创企业股权架构设计，到跨国集团的债务重组计划，团队为客户提供度身订造的解决方案：","深度诊断：提供深入财务分析，精准定位问题核心。","策略定制：由跨领域专家组成的专案团队，共同设计执行方案。","动态调整：定期根据市场变化与法规更新策略，确保解决方案贴合商业需求。"],"opportunities":["工作机会","招聘标题：","加入国林顾问，成就卓越未来！","我们正在寻找优秀人才，与我们一起创造非凡！","国林顾问招聘：专业团队期待你的加入！","招聘引言：","国林顾问有限公司成立于2022年9月，作为香港独有的综合专业服务顾问公司，我们致力于为客户提供一站式专业服务，涵盖公司并购、上市融资、科学调查报告、会计及税务、法律支援、资料保护、版权纠纷、企业及物业评估、企业推广等多个领域。我们正在寻找充满热情、专业且富有创新精神的人才加入我们的团队，共同成长与发展！","招聘职位：","1. 顾问助理","职位描述：","协助顾问团队进行市场调研、数据分析及报告撰写。","参与客户会议，协助制定解决方案。","跟进项目进度，确保项目顺利完成。","职位要求：","本科或以上学历，商业、金融、法律或相关专业优先。","具备良好的分析能力及沟通技巧。","熟练使用Microsoft Office（Word、Excel、PowerPoint）。","有相关实习经验者优先。","2. 会计及税务顾问","为客户提供会计及税务咨询服务，包括财务报表分析、税务规划等。","协助客户处理税务申报及审计相关事宜。","提供专业建议，帮助客户优化财务结构。","持有会计师资格（CPA、ACCA等）优先。","至少3年相关工作经验，熟悉香港税务法规。","具备良好的客户沟通能力及团队合作精神。","3. 法律支援专员","为客户提供法律咨询服务，包括合同审查、版权纠纷解决等。","协助客户处理法律文件及相关程序。","与外部律师事务所合作，确保法律事务顺利进行。","法律相关学位，持有律师执照者优先。","至少2年相关工作经验，熟悉香港法律法规。","具备良好的问题解决能力及细致的工作态度。","4. 企业推广专员","负责制定和执行企业推广策略，提升品牌知名度。","管理社交媒体平台，策划线上线下推广活动。","分析市场趋势，提供有效的推广建议。","市场营销、传播或相关专业本科学历。","具备良好的创意策划能力及执行力。","熟练使用社交媒体平台及推广工具。","我们提供：","具有竞争力的薪酬及福利待遇。","良好的职业发展机会及培训计划。","充满活力的工作环境及团队合作文化。","弹性工作时间及员工福利。","申请方式：","请将您的履历及求职信发送至：sklcl@yahoo.com","邮件标题请注明「应聘职位+姓名」。","我们将尽快与合适的候选人联系，安排面试。"],"founding":{"route":"cn-founding","title":"国林顾问有限公司正式成立","date":"2022-09-15","image":"assets/founding.jpg","content":["国林顾问有限公司正式成立","为您提供一站式专业服务","2022年9月，国林顾问有限公司在香港正式成立！作为一家综合性专业服务顾问公司，我们致力于为企业与个人客户提供全方位、跨领域的解决方案，涵盖法律支援、财务规划、市场分析及资产评估等多元服务。","我们的使命","在瞬息万变的商业环境中，企业面临的挑战日益复杂。国林顾问以「专业整合，成就卓越」为核心理念，集结法律、金融、科技及市场策略领域的顶尖专家，打造独有的一站式服务平台，协助客户精准应对挑战，把握机遇。","服务亮点","法律支援：涵盖版权纠纷、资料保护、商业合约审核等专业服务。","财务规划：提供企业融资、债务重组、税务优化等全面解决方案。","市场分析：基于科学调查与数据分析，为客户提供精准的市场洞察。","资产评估：专业的企业及物业估值服务，协助客户掌握资产价值。","国林顾问将持续深耕香港市场，并积极拓展国际合作网络，为客户提供更高效、更灵活的专业服务。我们期待与各界伙伴携手合作，共同创造卓越价值！"]},"languages":{"zhHant":"/","zhHans":"/zh-hans","en":"/en"},"_headings":["以数据为眼，为决策赋能","我们的服务内容","跨领域专业团队","技术驱动的精准分析","客制化报告交付","我们拒绝「模板化输出」，每份报告均包含：","可视化数据图表（热力图、趋势线等）","风险机遇双维度解读","具体行动建议与执行路径","应用场景","企业并购前的尽职调查","品牌进入新市场的可行性评估","商业纠纷中的证据搜集与分析","产品开发前的消费者需求验证","全程可追溯：所有数据来源与分析步骤透明化","跨界整合：结合法律合规性与商业实务需求","快速响应：紧急案件提供48小时初步分析报告","您的商业后盾，风险防线的筑造者","商业合约与纠纷","知识产权保护","资料保护与合规","跨境法律支援","一站式整合服务","深耕香港，实战经验丰富","敏捷应对，成本可控","为企业成长注入动力，为愿景铺平道路","融资策略规划","投资者匹配与路演支援","跨境融资与结构设计","上市筹备与执行","专业团队，全程陪伴","数据驱动的决策支持","本地化与国际化双重优势","捍卫您的权益，化解商业冲突","版权保护与维权","商业纠纷解决","跨境纠纷支援","法律与调查双重优势","本地化与国际化双重保障","灵活应对，成本可控","让您的品牌脱颖而出，赢得市场青睐","品牌定位与策略规划","多渠道推广执行","内容创作与传播","效果追踪与优化","专业团队，创意驱动","守护您的数据，保障您的未来","合规咨询与审计","数据安全管理","员工培训与意识提升","事件应急响应","法律与技术双重保障","定制化解决方案","精准估值，为您的资产把脉","企业价值评估","物业估值","尽职调查与风险评估","专业团队，数据驱动","重塑结构，释放企业潜能","结构优化与重组规划","财务重组与债务管理","法律合规与风险管理","员工与文化整合","驱动企业成长，创造协同价值","策略规划与目标筛选","交易执行与谈判支援","并购后整合与管理","化解财务压力，重启成长引擎","债务结构分析与评估","重组方案设计与执行","财务规划与营运优化","保护品牌价值，奠定市场优势","商标检索与评估","注册申请与文件准备","注册过程跟进与维护","商标维权与纠纷处理","专业团队，高效服务","数据驱动的风险管理","专业资历","学历与资格：","职业经历：","社会职务：","团队优势","前香港华人会计师公会主席","专业贡献","英国特许公认会计师公会资深会计师","香港执业会计师公会注册会计师 1983","专业经验","财华社集团执行董事兼负责人","中华人民共和国山东省政治协商委员会委员","专业领域：","专业资格：","香港城市大学法学博士","美国佛罗里达国际大学会计学硕士","美国佛罗里达国际大学经济系学士","香港执业大律师","CPA 注册会计师","投资成就：","时事评论与写作：","市场洞察与策略规划：","联络我们","繁体中文","简体中文","English","一站式专业网络","立足香港，放眼全球","客制化解决方案","招聘标题：","招聘引言：","招聘职位：","1. 顾问助理","职位描述：","职位要求：","2. 会计及税务顾问","3. 法律支援专员","4. 企业推广专员","我们提供：","申请方式：","为您提供一站式专业服务","我们的使命","服务亮点"]},"en":{"company":{"name":"SKL Consultancy Limited","english":"SKL Consultancy Limited","tagline":"One-stop professional services for mergers and acquisitions, legal support, corporate finance, accounting and taxation","summary":"Founded in Hong Kong in September 2022, SKL Consultancy Limited is an integrated professional consultancy. Our services include mergers and acquisitions, corporate finance, scientific investigation reports, accounting and taxation, legal support, data protection, copyright disputes, business and property valuation, corporate promotion and other one-stop solutions.","phone":"(852) 95886463","phoneDigits":"85295886463","email":"sklcl@yahoo.com","address":"Room 1715, 17/F, Concordia Plaza, 1 Science Museum Road, Tsim Sha Tsui, Kowloon, Hong Kong","wechat":"STARLEAD8"},"services":[{"route":"cn-scientificinvestigation","title":"Scientific Investigation","image":"assets/science.jpg","content":["Scientific Investigation","Data-led insight for better decisions","In an age of information overload, precise insight matters far more than acting blindly. SKL Consultancy's Scientific Investigation service combines rigorous academic methods with advanced technology to cut through market uncertainty and turn complex data into clear, practical guidance.","Our Services","Cross-disciplinary Professional Team","Our project teams bring together data scientists, industry analysts and legal advisers. From data collection and model building to interpretation of results, every stage is designed to maintain scientific rigour and regulatory compliance.","Technology-driven Precision Analysis","We use AI algorithms, big-data mining and statistical modelling to deliver in-depth insight in the following areas:","Market trend forecasting: interpret consumer behaviour and industry developments to identify future opportunities.","Competitor analysis: use public data and less obvious market signals to understand competitors' strategies and weaknesses.","Evidence chains for commercial disputes: verify facts scientifically and provide strong support for legal strategy.","Tailored Reports","We do not use one-size-fits-all templates. Every report includes:","Visual data presentations, including heat maps and trend lines","Analysis of both risks and opportunities","Specific recommendations and an implementation pathway","Applications","Due diligence before mergers and acquisitions","Feasibility studies for entering new markets","Evidence collection and analysis in commercial disputes","Validation of consumer demand before product development","Why Choose Us?","Data can mislead, but sound science should not. We follow three principles:","Full traceability: transparent data sources and analytical steps","Integrated expertise: alignment of legal compliance with practical business needs","Rapid response: a preliminary analysis report within 48 hours for urgent cases"]},{"route":"cn-lawconsultancy","title":"Legal Support","image":"assets/legal.jpg","content":["Legal Support","Your commercial safeguard and first line of defence against risk","Legal risk is present throughout today's complex and rapidly changing business environment. SKL Consultancy's Legal Support service combines a deep understanding of Hong Kong law with international practical experience, giving companies and individuals comprehensive protection from prevention through resolution so they can focus on their core business with confidence.","Our Services","Commercial Contracts and Disputes","Contract drafting and review: ensure terms comply with Hong Kong's Companies Ordinance and international business practice.","Commercial dispute mediation and litigation: provide balanced legal strategies for copyright disputes, contractual breaches and shareholder conflicts.","Intellectual Property Protection","Trademark registration and enforcement: help businesses develop trademark protection in Hong Kong and worldwide.","Copyright infringement: secure evidence quickly and pursue legal remedies to protect creative value.","Data Protection and Compliance","Develop corporate data-management arrangements in accordance with Hong Kong's Personal Data (Privacy) Ordinance.","Cross-border Legal Support","International commercial arbitration and enforcement of cross-border contracts.","Legal-risk assessment and structuring for overseas investments.","Why Choose Us?","Integrated One-stop Service","Legal issues rarely exist in isolation. Our legal advisers work seamlessly with our finance and investigation teams, for example:","Scientific investigation: build data-based evidence chains for legal disputes.","Business valuation: combine asset valuation with legal due diligence to safeguard acquisitions.","Strong Hong Kong Experience","Detailed knowledge of commercial legislation including Hong Kong's Competition Ordinance and Copyright Ordinance.","Experience covering start-up financing agreements and arbitration involving multinational groups.","Responsive and Cost-conscious","Preliminary legal advice within 24 hours for urgent matters.","Flexible fee arrangements based on project scope, time spent or risk-sharing, according to client needs."]},{"route":"cn-corporatefinance","title":"Corporate Finance","image":"assets/finance.jpg","content":["Corporate Finance","Funding business growth and turning vision into progress","Capital is essential to business growth in a competitive market. SKL Consultancy's Corporate Finance service combines professional financial planning with market insight to develop financing strategies tailored to each stage, from start-up to expansion, so that strong business ideas are not held back by funding constraints.","Our Services","Financing Strategy","Assess the company's current position and future needs, then prepare short- and long-term financing plans.","Provide a range of options, including equity, debt and hybrid financing.","Investor Matching and Roadshow Support","Match suitable investors or financial institutions to the company's positioning and stage of development.","Help prepare business plans, financial models and roadshow materials to improve the likelihood of successful financing.","Cross-border Financing and Structuring","Design tax-efficient financing structures for multinational companies and cross-border operations.","Advise on raising capital in international markets, including Hong Kong, Singapore, Europe and the United States.","Listing Preparation and Execution","Support preparations for listing on the Main Board or GEM in Hong Kong.","Provide pre-listing advice on financial audit, legal compliance and market positioning.","Why Choose Us?","Professional Support Throughout","Project teams combine experienced financial advisers, legal specialists and market analysts.","Professional and practical support is provided from strategy through implementation.","Data-driven Decisions","Combine scientific investigation and market analysis to assess financing feasibility with evidence.","Use AI and big-data techniques to forecast financing outcomes and risks more precisely.","Local and International Strengths","Strong understanding of Hong Kong capital-market rules and investor preferences.","Extensive cross-border financing experience that connects businesses with global capital."]},{"route":"cn-coporatedispute","title":"Copyright / Commercial Disputes","image":"assets/dispute.jpg","content":["Copyright / Commercial Disputes","Protecting your rights and resolving commercial conflict","In the knowledge economy, copyright and commercial disputes are common operational challenges. SKL Consultancy combines legal expertise with practical experience to provide end-to-end support, from prevention to resolution, and to protect each client's interests as fully as possible.","Our Services","Copyright Protection and Enforcement","Copyright registration and management: assist with copyright registration in Hong Kong and internationally.","Infringement investigation and evidence gathering: use scientific investigation techniques to collect reliable evidence.","Legal proceedings and settlement: protect copyright interests through litigation or negotiation.","Commercial Dispute Resolution","Contract disputes: provide legal advice and solutions for breaches, performance disputes and related matters.","Shareholder disputes: help resolve conflicts of interest and disagreements over shareholder rights.","Trade-secret protection: prepare confidentiality agreements and pursue unauthorised disclosure to protect core business assets.","Cross-border Dispute Support","International commercial arbitration: represent clients in international arbitration and protect cross-border interests.","Cross-border legal coordination: assist with disputes involving the laws of multiple jurisdictions.","Why Choose Us?","Combined Legal and Investigative Strength","Experienced lawyers and investigators work together so legal strategy and evidence gathering remain closely aligned.","AI and big-data techniques improve investigation efficiency and the reliability of evidence.","Local and International Protection","Detailed knowledge of Hong Kong's Copyright Ordinance and international intellectual-property law.","Extensive experience in cross-border disputes and international legal challenges.","Flexible and Cost-conscious","Litigation, mediation and arbitration options are tailored to the circumstances of each dispute.","Flexible fees may be based on project scope, time spent or risk-sharing, helping clients manage cost."]},{"route":"cn-businesspromote","title":"Corporate Promotion","image":"assets/promotion.jpg","content":["Corporate Promotion","Helping your brand stand out and earn market confidence","In an information-rich world, corporate promotion is not simply about distributing messages; it is central to building brand value and customer trust. SKL Consultancy combines market insight with creative strategy to develop effective campaigns tailored to each business and help brands stand out from their competitors.","Our Services","Brand Positioning and Strategy","Market research and competitor analysis: understand target markets and customer needs in depth.","Brand positioning and core messaging: create a distinctive identity and clear value proposition.","Multi-channel Campaign Delivery","Digital marketing: social-media promotion, search-engine optimisation (SEO) and online advertising.","Traditional media: television, radio and print advertising designed to extend brand reach.","Event planning: product launches, industry exhibitions and client events that increase brand exposure.","Content Creation and Communication","Creative copy and visual design: compelling advertising content and brand stories.","Public relations: press releases, media interviews and KOL partnerships that strengthen credibility.","Performance Tracking and Optimisation","Data analysis and reporting: use AI and big-data techniques to track campaign performance.","Continuous optimisation: adjust campaigns in response to evidence to maximise return on investment.","Why Choose Us?","Professional Team, Creative Thinking","Project teams combine market analysts, creative directors and digital-marketing specialists.","Comprehensive service from strategy through practical execution.","Data-driven Decisions","Combine scientific investigation with market analysis to provide evidence-based promotional recommendations.","Use AI and big data to forecast campaign performance and market response more precisely.","Local and International Strengths","Detailed understanding of Hong Kong's market and consumer behaviour.","Extensive cross-border campaign experience that helps businesses enter international markets."]},{"route":"cn-dataprotection","title":"Data Protection","image":"assets/data-protection.jpg","content":["Data Protection","Safeguarding your data and protecting your future","In the digital age, data is one of a company's most valuable assets and one of its most vulnerable. SKL Consultancy combines legal compliance with technical safeguards to deliver comprehensive data-security management and help businesses operate with confidence.","Our Services","Compliance Advice and Audit","Assess data-protection compliance under Hong Kong's Personal Data (Privacy) Ordinance and international standards such as the GDPR.","Provide compliance audit reports that identify potential risks and set out improvement plans.","Data-security Management","Design and implement data-classification and tiered-protection strategies.","Provide encryption, access-control and backup arrangements to maintain data security and availability.","Staff Training and Awareness","Deliver regular data-protection training to strengthen staff awareness.","Conduct simulated phishing exercises to assess and improve organisational defences.","Incident Response","Establish data-breach response plans for rapid action and reduced losses.","Provide investigation and legal support when responding to regulators and customers.","Why Choose Us?","Legal and Technical Protection","Legal specialists and IT-security advisers work together to ensure compliance and technical feasibility.","Seamless support from policy development through technical implementation.","Local and International Strengths","Detailed knowledge of Hong Kong's Personal Data (Privacy) Ordinance and international data-protection requirements.","Support for multinational organisations meeting international obligations including the GDPR.","Tailored Solutions","Data-protection arrangements tailored to the organisation's size and industry.","Ongoing monitoring and regular updates to maintain long-term compliance and security."]},{"route":"cn-propertvaluation","title":"Business & Property Valuation","image":"assets/valuation.jpg","content":["Business & Property Valuation","Accurate valuations that reveal the true position of your assets","Reliable asset valuation is fundamental to decision-making in a complex and changing market. SKL Consultancy combines professional expertise with data-driven analysis to deliver accurate, dependable valuation reports, helping clients understand the true value of their assets and make informed decisions.","Our Services","Business Valuation","Financial analysis and forecasting: assess profitability, cash flow and future growth potential.","Market approach: use transaction data from comparable businesses to establish a market-based value.","Asset-based valuation: assess a company's tangible and intangible assets comprehensively.","Property Valuation","Residential, commercial and industrial property: prepare accurate reports based on market trends and property characteristics.","Special-purpose property: assess hotels, car parks, development projects and other specialist assets.","Cross-border property: help clients assess overseas property with an international perspective.","Due Diligence and Risk Assessment","M&A and financing due diligence: provide professional valuation support for acquisitions, listings and financing.","Risk assessment and management: identify potential valuation risks and recommend appropriate responses.","Why Choose Us?","Professional and Data-led","Project teams bring together registered valuers, financial analysts and market-research specialists.","Local and International Strengths","In-depth knowledge of Hong Kong's property market and business environment.","Extensive cross-border valuation experience to support international requirements.","Tailored Solutions","One-off valuations or long-term asset-management support according to client needs.","Coordination with legal and financial advisers ensures each report is comprehensive and compliant."]},{"route":"cn-corporatereorganization","title":"Corporate Reorganisation","image":"assets/corporate-restructure.jpg","content":["Corporate Reorganisation","Reshaping structures to unlock business potential","Businesses need flexible structures and strategies to respond to a rapidly changing environment. SKL Consultancy combines legal, financial and operational expertise to help companies optimise their structure, improve efficiency and create a strong foundation for future growth.","Our Services","Structural Optimisation and Planning","Review the existing corporate structure to identify operational bottlenecks and areas of risk.","Develop reorganisation plans covering departmental integration, business separation and adjustments to holding structures.","Financial Reorganisation and Debt Management","Design debt-restructuring arrangements that improve the company's financial position.","Recommend capital-structure improvements that balance equity and debt.","Legal Compliance and Risk Management","Ensure the reorganisation complies with Hong Kong's Companies Ordinance and related legislation.","Identify and manage legal and tax risks throughout the process.","Workforce and Cultural Integration","Develop workforce-reorganisation plans that improve organisational structure and allocation of talent.","Support cultural integration to strengthen teamwork and execution.","Why Choose Us?","Professional Support Throughout","Project teams combine legal advisers, financial specialists and operational strategists.","One-stop support from diagnosis and planning through implementation.","Data-driven Decisions","Combine scientific investigation with financial analysis to make evidence-based recommendations.","Use AI and big-data techniques to model expected outcomes and risks.","Local and International Strengths","Strong knowledge of Hong Kong's business environment and laws ensures a compliant process.","Extensive cross-border reorganisation experience helps businesses manage international challenges."]},{"route":"cn-mergeandacquisition","title":"Mergers & Acquisitions","image":"assets/merger.jpg","content":["Mergers & Acquisitions","Driving business growth and creating value through synergy","Mergers and acquisitions can accelerate expansion and strengthen competitiveness. SKL Consultancy combines legal and financial expertise with market insight to support clients from strategy through execution, helping every transaction create the greatest possible value.","Our Services","Strategy and Target Screening","Market research and industry analysis: identify potential acquisition targets and merger opportunities.","Transaction structuring: design the most suitable acquisition or merger arrangement for the client's objectives.","Due Diligence and Risk Assessment","Financial due diligence: assess the target's financial condition and potential risks.","Legal due diligence: confirm compliance and identify potential legal issues.","Operational due diligence: analyse the target's business model and market competitiveness.","Execution and Negotiation Support","Support transaction negotiations to secure the best available terms and conditions.","Review legal documents and assist with execution to keep the process on track.","Post-merger Integration and Management","Develop integration plans covering organisational structure, business processes and corporate culture.","Provide ongoing support to maximise synergies and minimise risk.","Why Choose Us?","Professional Support Throughout","Project teams combine legal advisers, financial specialists and market analysts.","One-stop support from strategic planning through completion.","Data-driven Decisions","Combine scientific investigation with financial analysis to provide evidence-based transaction advice.","Use AI and big-data techniques to model transaction outcomes and risks.","Local and International Strengths","Strong knowledge of Hong Kong's business environment and laws ensures transaction compliance.","Extensive cross-border transaction experience helps clients manage international challenges."]},{"route":"cn-dentreorganization","title":"Debt Restructuring","image":"assets/debt.jpg","content":["Debt Restructuring","Relieving financial pressure and restarting the engine of growth","Economic volatility and market competition can turn debt into a serious obstacle to development. SKL Consultancy combines legal, financial and operational expertise to help companies redesign their debt structure, reduce financial pressure and create room for future growth.","Our Services","Debt Analysis and Assessment","Review the company's financial position comprehensively and identify the underlying causes of its debt difficulties.","Provide an evidence-based debt analysis report that defines restructuring needs and objectives.","Restructuring Design and Execution","Design arrangements such as extended repayment periods, reduced interest rates and debt-to-equity conversion.","Assist with creditor negotiations, agreement of terms and execution of restructuring documents.","Legal Compliance and Risk Management","Ensure the process complies with Hong Kong's Companies Ordinance and related legislation.","Identify and manage legal and tax risks arising from the restructuring.","Financial Planning and Operational Optimisation","Advise on cash-flow management and financial planning to establish stability after restructuring.","Help optimise operations to improve profitability and debt-servicing capacity.","Why Choose Us?","Professional Support Throughout","Project teams combine legal advisers, financial specialists and operational strategists.","One-stop debt-restructuring support from diagnosis and planning through implementation.","Data-driven Decisions","Combine scientific investigation with financial analysis to make evidence-based restructuring recommendations.","Use AI and big-data techniques to model outcomes and risks.","Local and International Strengths","Strong knowledge of Hong Kong's business environment and laws ensures compliance.","Extensive cross-border restructuring experience helps companies respond to international challenges."]},{"route":"cn-trademarkregistration","title":"Trademark Registration","image":"assets/trademark.jpg","content":["Trademark Registration","Protecting brand value and building a stronger market position","In a highly competitive market, a trademark is one of a company's most important intangible assets. SKL Consultancy combines legal expertise with market insight to complete registrations efficiently, protect brand value comprehensively and establish a firm basis for competition.","Our Services","Trademark Search and Assessment","Conduct comprehensive searches to assess the distinctiveness and viability of a proposed application.","Provide a professional assessment report identifying potential conflicts and risks.","Application and Document Preparation","Prepare and submit registration documents in compliance with Hong Kong's Trade Marks Ordinance.","Provide international registration services covering Mainland China, the European Union, the United States and other major markets.","Application Follow-up and Maintenance","Monitor progress throughout and respond promptly to official examination comments.","Handle renewals, amendments, assignments and other follow-up matters to maintain long-term protection.","Enforcement and Dispute Resolution","Assist with infringement matters and provide legal advice and litigation support.","Develop strategies and provide legal support for opposition and invalidation proceedings.","Why Choose Us?","Professional and Efficient","Project teams combine experienced intellectual-property lawyers and trademark agents.","One-stop support from searches and applications through enforcement.","Local and International Strengths","Detailed knowledge of Hong Kong's Trade Marks Ordinance and international registration procedures.","Extensive cross-border registration experience that supports international expansion.","Data-driven Risk Management","Use AI and big-data techniques to improve the accuracy and efficiency of trademark searches.","Provide evidence-based risk assessments to support informed decisions."]}],"people":[{"route":"cn-stephen-wong-kai-yi","name":"Stephen Wong Kai-yi","english":"Barrister at Law","image":"assets/stephen-wong.jpg","content":["Stephen Wong Kai-yi, Barrister at Law","Professional Qualifications","Education and Qualifications:","Graduated from the University of Hong Kong and later received a government legal scholarship for further study in the United Kingdom.","Admitted as a solicitor of the Supreme Court of England and Wales; holds a Master of Laws from the London School of Economics and Political Science, specialising in intellectual property, civil litigation, maritime law and marine insurance; and is admitted as a barrister of the High Court of Australia.","Undertook further studies at leading institutions including Tsinghua University and Harvard Kennedy School.","Professional Experience:","Joined the Hong Kong Department of Justice in 1986 and served as Senior Crown Counsel, Assistant Director of Public Prosecutions and Deputy Principal Government Counsel, with responsibility for legal matters relating to the Handover.","Promoted to Principal Government Counsel in 1997, overseeing human rights, Basic Law and Hong Kong–Mainland legal affairs, and became the first Chinese Deputy Law Officer.","From 2007 to 2012, served as a directorate officer in the Hong Kong Economic and Trade Offices in Brussels and Berlin, including as Director of the Berlin office.","Served as Hong Kong Privacy Commissioner for Personal Data from 2015 to 2020, advancing data protection and privacy compliance.","Now practises privately as a barrister, focusing on human rights, professional conduct, financial and data regulation, and commercial disputes.","Public and Professional Appointments:","Chairman of the Independent Vetting Committee of the Hong Kong Big Data Governance Association and adviser to the Hong Kong Genome Institute.","Also serves as an invited professor at Beijing Normal University Law School and a big-data expert of the Greater Bay Area International Information Technology Association.","Value to Our Team","Mr Wong brings SKL Consultancy an international outlook and deep legal expertise. His experience and extensive professional network enable our team to support clients from legal advice through cross-border dispute resolution. Whether the matter involves mergers and acquisitions, data protection or commercial litigation, we provide professional and efficient support."]},{"route":"cn-patrick-wong","name":"Patrick Lung-tak Wong","english":"BBS, JP","image":"assets/patrick-wong.jpg","content":["Professor Patrick Lung-tak Wong, BBS, JP","Professional Qualifications","Education and Qualifications:","Graduated from Hong Kong Polytechnic with a diploma in accountancy and management studies.","Fellow of the Institute of Chartered Accountants in England and Wales, the Association of Chartered Certified Accountants and the Association of International Accountants.","Fellow of the Hong Kong Chartered Governance Institute, the Hong Kong Institute of Chartered Secretaries and the Taxation Institute of Hong Kong.","Professional Experience:","Former President of the Society of Chinese Accountants and Auditors.","Founded Patrick Wong C.P.A. Limited, providing comprehensive accounting, audit and taxation services.","Has served as an independent non-executive director of several listed companies, helping improve corporate governance and financial transparency.","Served as an adjunct professor at the School of Accounting and Finance of The Hong Kong Polytechnic University from 2002 to 2013 and was appointed visiting professor at Wuyi University in Jiangmen, Guangdong.","Public and Professional Appointments:","Governor of the Hong Kong Baptist University Foundation and chairman of the Accounting Advisory Committee of its Department of Accountancy, Economics and Finance.","Member of the Board of Management of the Chinese Permanent Cemeteries and chairman of the To Kwa Wan Kaifong Welfare Association.","Former member of the ninth and tenth Yunnan Provincial Committees of the Chinese People's Political Consultative Conference, with active involvement in community and charitable work.","Professional Contributions","Scrutineering: Professor Wong is widely recognised as an election and ballot scrutineer. He has supervised voting and prize draws for major events, including RTHK's Top Ten Chinese Gold Songs Awards and the TVB Miss Hong Kong Pageant, helping ensure fairness and transparency.","Charitable service: he has provided pro bono audit services to more than 300 non-profit organisations and supported education through donations, including the establishment of a scholarship in the name of Patrick Wong C.P.A. Limited.","Industry leadership: he remains active in accounting, taxation and other professional bodies, promoting professional standards and sector development.","Value to Our Team","Professor Wong brings extensive accounting expertise and broad community connections to SKL Consultancy. His experience and leadership strengthen our ability to provide services ranging from financial audit and tax planning to corporate governance. Our team can support business listings, financial restructuring and the audit needs of charitable organisations professionally and efficiently."]},{"route":"cn-robert-chui","name":"Robert Tsui Chi Yan","english":"MH","image":"assets/robert-chui.jpg","content":["Robert Tsui Chi Yan, MH","Professional Qualifications","Education and Qualifications:","Awarded a Bachelor of Commerce degree in 1978 and qualified as a certified public accountant in Hong Kong.","Became a fellow of the Association of Chartered Certified Accountants in 1989 and a fellow of the Hong Kong Institute of Certified Public Accountants in 1991.","Professional Experience:","Managing Director of Robert Tsui CPA Limited, specialising in corporate audit, tax planning and financial advisory services.","Has served as an independent non-executive director of a number of companies listed on the Hong Kong Stock Exchange, including Tse Sui Luen Jewellery (International) Limited and National Arts Entertainment and Culture Group Limited.","Currently serves as an independent non-executive director of companies including Asia Cassava Resources Holdings Limited and F8 Enterprises (Holdings) Group Limited.","Public and Professional Appointments:","Honorary Commissioner of the Hong Kong Road Safety Patrol and member of various committees under the Transport and Housing Bureau.","Founding chairman and permanent honorary president of the Shenzhen–Hong Kong Youth Exchange Promotion Association, promoting exchange and cooperation between young people in the two cities.","Chairman of the China Education Development Foundation, supporting education and public welfare."]},{"route":"cn-alexander-tai","name":"Alexander Tai Kwok Leung","english":"","image":"assets/alexander-tai.png","content":["Alexander Tai Kwok Leung","Mr Tai has more than 30 years of experience in securities trading, company listings, corporate finance, mergers and acquisitions, and is widely recognised as a leading finance professional. He was a partner of VMS Group until 2013. During his time at VMS Securities Limited, he personally supervised asset-management operations of approximately US$2.5 billion.","He has also held senior roles at KPMG, PricewaterhouseCoopers and Standard Chartered Asia Limited, giving him extensive experience across banking, asset management and related financial fields.","Professional Qualifications","Fellow accountant and SFC-registered financial adviser for Type 4 regulated activity.","Fellow of the Association of Chartered Certified Accountants.","Registered with the Hong Kong Institute of Certified Public Accountants since 1983.","Approved by the Securities and Futures Commission to conduct Type 1 (dealing in securities), Type 4 (advising on securities) and Type 9 (asset management) regulated activities.","Professional Experience","Non-executive director of Shengjing Bank Co., Ltd. (Hong Kong stock code: 2066).","Executive director and responsible officer of Finet Group.","Member of the Shandong Provincial Committee of the Chinese People's Political Consultative Conference.","Independent non-executive director of WuXi Biologics (2269), chairman of its audit committee and member of its nomination committee.","Secretary-general of the Hong Kong Capital Markets Association of Professionals, promoting the development of Hong Kong's financial-services industry."]},{"route":"-jp","name":"Serena Lau Sze Wan","english":"JP","image":"assets/serena-lau.jpg","content":["Serena Lau Sze Wan, JP","Professional Qualifications","Education and Qualifications:","Holds an MBA from the University of Hong Kong and is a registered professional surveyor in Hong Kong (general practice). Her professional qualifications include FHKIS, AAPI and MRICS. She is also a fellow of the Hong Kong Institute of Surveyors and has served on professional disciplinary bodies.","Professional Experience:","Managing Director of RHL International, specialising in real-estate valuation, market research and project-feasibility studies in Hong Kong, Mainland China and overseas. Her work has included planning, development and operational consultancy for the Dan Gui Yuan resort theme park in Kunshan, Jiangsu, as well as sustainability analysis, planning and development advice for Mainland government bodies and developers.","Public and Professional Appointments:","Member of the Hong Kong Housing Authority; chairman of its Commercial Properties Committee and member of its Strategic Planning Committee; member of the Supervisory Board of the Hong Kong Housing Society; member of the Legal Aid Services Council; chairperson of the Advisory Committee of the Chinese Medicine Development Fund; member of the Youth Development Commission, the Trade and Industry Department's Small and Medium Enterprises Committee, and the Hong Kong Institute of Surveyors Disciplinary Panel; and a lay assessor of the Medical Council of Hong Kong. She previously served as a director of the Urban Renewal Fund, a member of the Estate Agents Authority and president of the Hong Kong Institute of Surveyors."]},{"route":"cn-tam-yiu-kwok","name":"Tam Yiu Keung","english":"","image":"assets/tam-yiu-keung.jpg","content":["Tam Yiu Keung","Professional Qualifications","Professional Experience:","Former Assistant Commissioner (Intelligence and Investigation) of Hong Kong Customs and Excise, leading major enforcement operations that froze assets belonging to criminal groups and strengthened action against piracy and infringement.","Co-organised an international intellectual-property enforcement conference with INTERPOL in 2010, sharing Hong Kong Customs' enforcement experience and promoting international cooperation.","During his tenure, successfully advanced the inclusion of piracy offences under the Organised and Serious Crimes Ordinance, significantly strengthening enforcement effectiveness.","Areas of Expertise:","Focuses on intellectual-property protection, organised-crime investigation and international law-enforcement cooperation, providing businesses with comprehensive risk-management and compliance advice."]},{"route":"alan-au","name":"Alan Au Kai Lun","english":"Barrister at Law","image":"assets/alan-au.jpg","content":["Alan Au Kai Lun, Barrister at Law","Mr Au has extensive expertise and experience in corporate restructuring, mergers and acquisitions, commercial disputes, regulatory and disciplinary matters, and listing rules. He also handles a broad range of criminal and civil litigation, particularly cases involving securities and futures regulation.","Professional Qualifications:","Juris Doctor, City University of Hong Kong.","Master of Accounting, Florida International University, United States.","Bachelor's degree in Economics, Florida International University, United States.","Practising barrister in Hong Kong.","Certified Public Accountant.","Professional Experience:","Chairman of the Hong Kong Institute of Certified Public Accountants Legal and Compliance Task Force (2021).","Member of the HKICPA Governance Committee (2019–2021).","Member of the HKICPA Election Committee (2019–2023).","Member of the HKICPA Taxation Faculty Executive Committee (2019–2022).","Member of the HKICPA Restructuring and Insolvency Faculty Executive Committee (2019–2023)."]},{"route":"cn-chow-hin","name":"Micro Chow Hin","english":"","image":"assets/chow-hin.jpg","content":["Micro Chow Hin","Professional Qualifications","A well-known financial writer and experienced political and economic public-relations professional, often known as 'Master Chow'. He writes columns for Ming Pao, am730, Headline Daily, Sing Tao Daily, Orange News, Hong Kong Commercial Daily and the Mainland publication Guancha.cn, and operates the YouTube channel Chow TV. He has published books across several genres, including the bestsellers Stock Trading Code and Practical Stock Trading.","Investment Achievements:","He first entered the stock market in 1999 and, within six months, reportedly grew initial capital of HK$100,000 to HK$10 million, demonstrating strong market judgement and execution.","Over many years of investing, he has reported an 80% success rate apart from 2002 and has published personal investment records demonstrating practical experience.","He focuses on identifying market trends and value-investment opportunities and provides investment and asset-allocation advice.","Commentary and Writing:","With ten years' experience as a newspaper leader writer and twenty years as a current-affairs commentator, he has long contributed columns analysing economic, political and social developments.","He has published multiple books on investment and market analysis, sharing practical experience in accessible and humorous language.","Market Insight and Strategy:","Combines investment experience with current-affairs analysis to advise businesses on market trends and competitive strategy.","Interprets policy changes and industry developments from macroeconomic and market perspectives, helping clients identify opportunities."]}],"about":["About Us","Contact Us","Traditional Chinese","Simplified Chinese","English","SKL Consultancy Limited was established in September 2022 to serve as a strategic partner to corporate and individual clients. In a fast-changing business environment, we understand that clients face interconnected challenges across multiple disciplines and that a single-specialism service is often insufficient. We therefore bring together leading specialists in law, finance, technology and market strategy to create one of Hong Kong's foremost cross-disciplinary consultancy platforms.","An Integrated Professional Network","Whether the need concerns financial planning for a merger, legal strategy in a copyright dispute or data validation in a scientific investigation, we provide a connected service chain:","Early-stage strategy: market research, risk assessment and financing-structure design.","Execution support: legal-document review, asset valuation and trademark registration.","Long-term support: data-protection compliance, corporate-reorganisation advice and brand-promotion strategy.","Clients do not need to coordinate several providers; SKL's team manages their requirements efficiently through one point of contact.","Based in Hong Kong, Connected Globally","Our team understands local and international requirements and provides professional support with both local knowledge and an international outlook:","Local expertise: detailed knowledge of legislation including Hong Kong's Companies Ordinance and Copyright Ordinance, as well as local property-valuation standards and tax policy.","International perspective: support for international commercial arbitration, cross-border mergers and acquisitions, global tax planning and other international matters through a connected professional network.","Tailored Solutions","From equity-structure design for start-ups to debt-restructuring plans for multinational groups, our team develops solutions around each client's circumstances:","Detailed diagnosis: in-depth financial analysis to identify the central issue accurately.","Tailored strategy: a cross-disciplinary project team designs the implementation plan together.","Dynamic adjustment: regular updates in response to market and regulatory changes keep each solution aligned with business needs."],"opportunities":["Career Opportunities","Recruitment Title:","Join SKL Consultancy and Build an Exceptional Future","We are looking for talented people to create outstanding work with us.","SKL Consultancy is hiring—join our professional team.","Introduction:","Established in September 2022, SKL Consultancy Limited is an integrated professional-services consultancy in Hong Kong. We provide one-stop services covering mergers and acquisitions, corporate finance, scientific investigation reports, accounting and taxation, legal support, data protection, copyright disputes, business and property valuation, corporate promotion and related fields. We welcome passionate, professional and innovative people who want to grow with our team.","Current Vacancies:","1. Assistant Consultant","Responsibilities:","Assist the consultancy team with market research, data analysis and report preparation.","Participate in client meetings and help develop solutions.","Monitor project progress and help ensure successful completion.","Requirements:","Bachelor's degree or above; business, finance, law or a related discipline is preferred.","Strong analytical and communication skills.","Proficiency in Microsoft Office, including Word, Excel and PowerPoint.","Relevant internship experience is an advantage.","2. Accounting and Tax Consultant","Provide accounting and tax advisory services, including financial-statement analysis and tax planning.","Assist clients with tax filings, audits and related matters.","Provide professional advice to help clients optimise their financial structure.","A professional accounting qualification such as CPA or ACCA is preferred.","At least three years of relevant experience and familiarity with Hong Kong tax regulations.","Strong client communication and teamwork skills.","3. Legal Support Officer","Provide legal support including contract review and assistance with copyright disputes.","Assist clients with legal documents and related procedures.","Coordinate with external law firms to ensure legal matters progress smoothly.","Degree in law or a related discipline; legal professional qualification is preferred.","At least two years of relevant experience and familiarity with Hong Kong law.","Strong problem-solving skills and careful attention to detail.","4. Corporate Promotion Officer","Develop and implement corporate-promotion strategies to increase brand awareness.","Manage social-media channels and plan online and offline campaigns.","Analyse market trends and make effective promotional recommendations.","Bachelor's degree in marketing, communications or a related discipline.","Strong creative-planning and execution skills.","Proficiency with social-media platforms and promotional tools.","What We Offer:","Competitive remuneration and benefits.","Strong career-development opportunities and training programmes.","A dynamic working environment and collaborative team culture.","Flexible working arrangements and employee benefits.","How to Apply:","Please send your CV and cover letter to sklcl@yahoo.com.","Use 'Position Applied For + Name' as the email subject.","We will contact suitable candidates as soon as possible to arrange an interview."],"founding":{"route":"cn-founding","title":"SKL Consultancy Limited Officially Established","date":"2022-09-15","image":"assets/founding.jpg","content":["SKL Consultancy Limited Officially Established","One-stop Professional Services for You","SKL Consultancy Limited was officially established in Hong Kong in September 2022. As an integrated professional-services consultancy, we provide corporate and individual clients with comprehensive, cross-disciplinary solutions covering legal support, financial planning, market analysis, asset valuation and other specialist services.","Our Mission","Businesses face increasingly complex challenges in a rapidly changing environment. Guided by the principle 'Integrated Expertise, Exceptional Results', SKL Consultancy brings together leading specialists in law, finance, technology and market strategy to create a distinctive one-stop platform that helps clients respond accurately to challenges and capture opportunities.","Service Highlights","Legal support: professional assistance with copyright disputes, data protection and commercial-contract review.","Financial planning: comprehensive solutions for corporate finance, debt restructuring and tax optimisation.","Market analysis: precise market insight based on scientific investigation and data analysis.","Asset valuation: professional business and property valuation that helps clients understand asset value.","SKL Consultancy will continue to deepen its work in Hong Kong while expanding its international network. We aim to provide more efficient and flexible professional services and look forward to working with partners from every sector to create lasting value."]},"languages":{"zhHant":"/","zhHans":"/zh-hans","en":"/en"},"_headings":["Data-led insight for better decisions","Our Services","Cross-disciplinary Professional Team","Technology-driven Precision Analysis","Tailored Reports","We do not use one-size-fits-all templates. Every report includes:","Visual data presentations, including heat maps and trend lines","Analysis of both risks and opportunities","Specific recommendations and an implementation pathway","Applications","Due diligence before mergers and acquisitions","Feasibility studies for entering new markets","Evidence collection and analysis in commercial disputes","Validation of consumer demand before product development","Full traceability: transparent data sources and analytical steps","Integrated expertise: alignment of legal compliance with practical business needs","Rapid response: a preliminary analysis report within 48 hours for urgent cases","Your commercial safeguard and first line of defence against risk","Commercial Contracts and Disputes","Intellectual Property Protection","Data Protection and Compliance","Cross-border Legal Support","Integrated One-stop Service","Strong Hong Kong Experience","Responsive and Cost-conscious","Funding business growth and turning vision into progress","Financing Strategy","Investor Matching and Roadshow Support","Cross-border Financing and Structuring","Listing Preparation and Execution","Professional Support Throughout","Data-driven Decisions","Local and International Strengths","Protecting your rights and resolving commercial conflict","Copyright Protection and Enforcement","Commercial Dispute Resolution","Cross-border Dispute Support","Combined Legal and Investigative Strength","Local and International Protection","Flexible and Cost-conscious","Helping your brand stand out and earn market confidence","Brand Positioning and Strategy","Multi-channel Campaign Delivery","Content Creation and Communication","Performance Tracking and Optimisation","Professional Team, Creative Thinking","Safeguarding your data and protecting your future","Compliance Advice and Audit","Data-security Management","Staff Training and Awareness","Incident Response","Legal and Technical Protection","Tailored Solutions","Accurate valuations that reveal the true position of your assets","Business Valuation","Property Valuation","Due Diligence and Risk Assessment","Professional and Data-led","Reshaping structures to unlock business potential","Structural Optimisation and Planning","Financial Reorganisation and Debt Management","Legal Compliance and Risk Management","Workforce and Cultural Integration","Driving business growth and creating value through synergy","Strategy and Target Screening","Execution and Negotiation Support","Post-merger Integration and Management","Relieving financial pressure and restarting the engine of growth","Debt Analysis and Assessment","Restructuring Design and Execution","Financial Planning and Operational Optimisation","Protecting brand value and building a stronger market position","Trademark Search and Assessment","Application and Document Preparation","Application Follow-up and Maintenance","Enforcement and Dispute Resolution","Professional and Efficient","Data-driven Risk Management","Professional Qualifications","Education and Qualifications:","Professional Experience:","Public and Professional Appointments:","Value to Our Team","Former President of the Society of Chinese Accountants and Auditors.","Professional Contributions","Fellow of the Association of Chartered Certified Accountants.","Registered with the Hong Kong Institute of Certified Public Accountants since 1983.","Professional Experience","Executive director and responsible officer of Finet Group.","Member of the Shandong Provincial Committee of the Chinese People's Political Consultative Conference.","Areas of Expertise:","Professional Qualifications:","Juris Doctor, City University of Hong Kong.","Master of Accounting, Florida International University, United States.","Bachelor's degree in Economics, Florida International University, United States.","Practising barrister in Hong Kong.","Certified Public Accountant.","Investment Achievements:","Commentary and Writing:","Market Insight and Strategy:","Contact Us","Traditional Chinese","Simplified Chinese","English","An Integrated Professional Network","Based in Hong Kong, Connected Globally","Recruitment Title:","Introduction:","Current Vacancies:","1. Assistant Consultant","Responsibilities:","Requirements:","2. Accounting and Tax Consultant","3. Legal Support Officer","4. Corporate Promotion Officer","What We Offer:","How to Apply:","One-stop Professional Services for You","Our Mission","Service Highlights"]}};
